{
 "type": "doc",
 "version": 1,
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. What happens now"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "On the Parts Velocity report the Location column appears in the middle of the table, in sixth place, after Vendor. The written description asks for it to be the first column of all, before Type."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "2. What should happen instead"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Parts Velocity specification, version 5, requirement S7-R8: \"When shown (S2-R12 / S3-R10), the per-row Location column renders as the leftmost column, before Type, using the suite's standard column treatment so its placement matches the same column on the other reports in the suite.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "3. How to see it"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sign in as a user who can see more than one location and open "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Reports",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " > "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Parts Velocity",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Leave the Location filter on "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "All locations",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ", so more than one location is in view."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Read the column headings from left to right."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Open the three-dot menu and choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Download (CSV)",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ", then read the heading row of the downloaded file."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Exact test data this was seen with:",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " locations "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Heavy Duty - 9919",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", date range "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "This Year",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", type "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Both",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", no search. The organisation is "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Foothills Group Inc",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "4. What was actually shown"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "On screen, left to right:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Type | Part # | Description | Category | Vendor | Location | Units Sold | Unit Cost | Sell Price | Revenue | Margin | Margin % | Demand | Last Sale | On Hand"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The downloaded spreadsheet puts it in the same sixth place:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Type,\"Part #\",Description,Category,Vendor,Location,\"Units Sold\",\"Unit Cost\",\"Sell Price\",Revenue,Margin,\"Margin %\",Demand,\"Last Sale\",\"On Hand\""
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "{noquote}"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "5. What was ruled out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the column chooser.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The Location column is not one of the twenty entries in the column chooser, so a user cannot have moved or re-enabled it - the report places it there itself."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The rest of the column behaviour is correct.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The column only appears when more than one location is in view; each stocked row shows its own location's name; and a special-order row that covers several locations correctly shows the word "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Multiple",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not only the screen.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " Both downloads place it in the same wrong position, because they follow the screen."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "6. How often"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Every time, on every view looked at."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "7. Where it was seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Reports > Parts Velocity, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " "
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Parts Velocity report specification, version 5, requirement S7-R8, which says: \"When shown (S2-R12 / S3-R10), the per-row Location column renders as the leftmost column, before Type, using the suite's standard column treatment so its placement matches the same column on the other reports in the suite.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The same specification, requirement S2-R12, says when it is shown at all: \"When the Location filter (S2-R9) resolves to more than one location in scope, the table shows a per-row Location column identifying each row's location; when a single location is in scope the column is hidden.\""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}